on\"></i>\r\n<span title=\"Encoded anonymized location\">pEQ</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"upost\"><time>28 Mar 2026</time></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"uopin\">Camera using GCam is great, stock is meh. The performance of this phone is the worst. If i would recommend use this phone for camera or performance i would use camera because performance here is the worst i have ever seen.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"uinfo\">\r\n<li class=\"ureply\">\r\n<span title=\"Reply to this post\">\r\n<a href=\"postopinion.php3?idPhone=11832&idOpinion=7045902\">Reply</a></span>\r\n</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n<div class=\"user-thread\">\r\n<div class=\"uavatar\"><span class=\"avatar-box\" style=\"background-color: #806cb1\">?</span></div>\r\n<ul class=\"uinfo2\">\r\n<li class=\"uname2\">Anonymous</li>\r\n<li class=\"ulocation\">\r\n<i class=\"head-icon icon-location\"></i>\r\n<span title=\"Encoded anonymized location\">KLR</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"upost\"><time>10 Jan 2026</time></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"uopin\">Yeah stock camera app doesn&#039;t take great pictures, you better off using Gcam LMC8.4 to get impressive snapshots and keep stock cam app for videos</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"uinfo\">\r\n<li class=\"ureply\">\r\n<span title=\"Reply to this post\">\r\n<a href=\"postopinion.php3?idPhone=11832&idOpinion=7027064\">Reply</a></span>\r\n</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n<div class=\"user-thread\">\r\n<div class=\"uavatar\"><span class=\"avatar-box\" style=\"background-color: #549fc8\">n</span></div>\r\n<ul class=\"uinfo2\">\r\n<li class=\"uname\"><a href=\"user.php3?idUser=1225006\"><b>neededausername</b></a></li>\r\n<li class=\"ulocation\">\r\n<i class=\"head-icon icon-location\"></i>\r\n<span title=\"Encoded anonymized location\">8@5</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"upost\"><time>06 Jan 2026</time></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"uopin\">By the way if you&#039;re wondering, I think its camera is really GREAT, it holds surprisingly well for it&#039;s price range. And the CPU is great too, although a bit more modest than high end phones, but that&#039;s irrelevant considering this is b...</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"uinfo\">\r\n<li class=\"ureply\">\r\n<span title=\"Reply to this post\">\r\n<a href=\"postopinion.php3?idPhone=11832&idOpinion=7025843\">Reply</a></span>\r\n</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n<div class=\"sub-footer\">\r\n<div class=\"button-links\">\r\n<ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n<li><a class=\"button\" href=\"xiaomi_poco_m5s-reviews-11832.php\">Read all opinions</a></li>\r\n<li><a class=\"button\" href=\"postopinion.php3?idPhone=11832\">Post your opinion</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"opinions-total\">Total user opinions: <b>225</b></div>\r\n<br class=\"clear\" />\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"module module-vid-review\">\r\n<iframe width=\"728\" height=\"410\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sgeZvb9JOLs\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\t\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"adv bottom-728\" adonis-marker data-pan-sizes=\"[[728,90]]\">\r\n<span class=\"ad-c-label\">ADVERTISEMENT</span>\t\r\n<!-- /14566801/lb-728x90-ba -->\r\n<div id='lb-728x90-ba' style='min-width: 728px; min-height: 90px;'>\r\n</div>\r\n\t</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<aside class=\"sidebar col left\">\r\n\r\n<div class=\"brandmenu-v2 light l-box clearfix\">\r\n<p class=\"pad\">\r\n<a href=\"search.php3\" class=\"pad-single pad-finder\">\r\n<i class=\"head-icon icon-search-right\"></i>\r\n<span>Phone finder</span></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"samsung-phones-9.php\">Samsung</a></li><li><a href=\"apple-phones-48.php\">Apple</a></li><li><a href=\"huawei-phones-58.php\">Huawei</a></li><li><a href=\"nokia-phones-1.php\">Nokia</a></li><li><a href=\"sony-phones-7.php\">Sony</a></li><li><a href=\"lg-phones-20.php\">LG</a></li><li><a href=\"htc-phones-45.php\">